00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.080 line:95%
<c.green> -Bonjour ! </c>

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:38.480 line:95%
<c.green> Oh, qu'il est mignon, </c>

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.640 line:95%
<c.green> ce petit bout de chou 
